1
00:00:54,119 --> 00:00:54,759
How about

2
00:00:55,119 --> 00:00:56,359
dumping the cash out of the bag

3
00:00:56,359 --> 00:00:57,280
and showing them?

4
00:00:57,520 --> 00:00:59,679
Let them see what real wealth looks like.

5
00:01:01,079 --> 00:01:01,840
Forget it.

6
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:03,119
Never flaunt your wealth.

7
00:01:03,960 --> 00:01:04,879
Step aside.

8
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:08,719
Good dogs don't block the way, got it?

9
00:01:11,319 --> 00:01:12,239
Qianqian,

10
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:13,439
Nannan...

11
00:01:16,719 --> 00:01:17,760
did you two make up?

12
00:01:18,719 --> 00:01:20,840
Why didn't you tell me?

13
00:01:20,959 --> 00:01:23,040
What... What nonsense are you saying?

14
00:01:23,439 --> 00:01:24,640
Who made up with him?

15
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:25,719
You didn't?

16
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:28,159
Then why'd you spend hundreds of yuan

17
00:01:28,159 --> 00:01:29,640
just to buy clothes he designed?

18
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:32,920
Oh, my goodness!

19
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:34,760
Was this... really designed by Ma Dawei?

20
00:01:34,959 --> 00:01:36,799
You're really supporting our factory!

21
00:01:38,040 --> 00:01:39,959
What do you mean, Nannan?

22
00:01:40,799 --> 00:01:41,680
How could this outfit

23
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:43,640
have anything to do with him?

24
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:45,799
This is a high-end item

25
00:01:45,799 --> 00:01:46,840
I bought at an upscale mall!

26
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:48,319
I spent four or five hundred yuan on it!

27
00:01:48,719 --> 00:01:49,400
Nannan,

28
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:51,319
don't joke around.

29
00:01:52,079 --> 00:01:53,959
Auntie, why would I lie to you?

30
00:01:54,560 --> 00:01:55,280
If you don't believe me,

31
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:56,519
look at that silk scarf.

32
00:01:56,640 --> 00:01:58,079
It even has Jinhua Garment Factory's logo!

33
00:01:58,799 --> 00:01:59,560
It really has a logo!

34
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:01,920
Really?

35
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:02,640
Is it really there?

36
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:03,400
For real?

37
00:02:06,159 --> 00:02:07,480
Good grief!

38
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:10,120
Dawei really designed this outfit?

39
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:13,120
It sells for hundreds of yuan each in the mall!

40
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:16,120
How much does Jinhua Garment Factory
make a day now?

41
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:17,280
Come on, let's

42
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:18,400
go check it out at the mall too!

43
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:19,280
Let's go, let's go.

44
00:02:21,039 --> 00:02:22,039
Don't fall for his nonsense!

45
00:02:22,039 --> 00:02:22,840
Let's just go.

46
00:02:23,599 --> 00:02:25,759
Even if Jinhua Garment Factory made this,

47
00:02:26,039 --> 00:02:28,319
who can prove he designed them?

48
00:02:28,319 --> 00:02:29,360
Who saw it with their own eyes?

49
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:30,479
Let's go, Qianqian.

50
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:31,400
Let's go home.

51
00:02:31,879 --> 00:02:33,080
Don't listen to his bragging.

52
00:02:33,199 --> 00:02:34,039
Let's go.

53
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:35,840
Qianqian!

54
00:02:36,919 --> 00:02:37,520
Qianqian!

55
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:40,159
Qianqian!

56
00:02:41,759 --> 00:02:42,680
It's all your fault!

57
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:44,080
Now Qianqian's misunderstood me!

58
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:45,960
How is that my fault?

59
00:02:47,360 --> 00:02:47,960
You...

60
00:02:48,759 --> 00:02:49,719
What's wrong with you?

61
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:54,479
Qianqian!

62
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:56,240
Wait for me, Qianqian!

63
00:03:01,479 --> 00:03:02,319
Dawei's back!

64
00:03:05,319 --> 00:03:06,879
What's all the racket outside about?

65
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:08,639
Just people with nothing better to do.

66
00:03:08,639 --> 00:03:09,240
Ignore them.

67
00:03:10,319 --> 00:03:10,759
Dad,

68
00:03:11,960 --> 00:03:12,520
Sister-in-law,

69
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:15,120
look at this!

70
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:34,159
Holy smokes!

71
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,159
Dawei...

72
00:03:36,719 --> 00:03:37,919
Did you rob a bank?

73
00:03:38,159 --> 00:03:39,439
Rob a bank? Of course not!

74
00:03:39,599 --> 00:03:40,680
We earned this.

75
00:03:40,759 --> 00:03:43,199
First payout from Jinhua Garment Factory!

76
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:45,080
Those clothes sold like crazy!

77
00:03:45,280 --> 00:03:46,240
Not just in the provincial capital...

78
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:48,639
Even folks from neighboring provinces
drove overnight to snatch them up!

79
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:54,360
Dad,

80
00:03:54,879 --> 00:03:55,400
Sister-in-law,

81
00:03:56,039 --> 00:03:57,479
I just paid off all our family's debt.

82
00:03:57,879 --> 00:03:59,000
The rest is for you.

83
00:03:59,280 --> 00:03:59,919
From now on,

84
00:03:59,919 --> 00:04:01,439
we won't have to pinch pennies anymore.

85
00:04:03,560 --> 00:04:04,159
Dad,

86
00:04:04,439 --> 00:04:06,000
our Dawei has really made us proud!

87
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:07,639
He's truly a big boss now!

88
00:04:08,319 --> 00:04:08,960
Dawei,

89
00:04:10,639 --> 00:04:11,560
from now on, Dad...

90
00:04:15,039 --> 00:04:16,079
will never beat you again!

91
00:04:33,319 --> 00:04:34,120
Qianqian!

92
00:04:35,360 --> 00:04:36,079
Qianqian!

93
00:04:38,959 --> 00:04:39,759
Qianqian!

94
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,040
Qianqian!

95
00:04:45,839 --> 00:04:46,519
Nannan.

96
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:48,399
Don't be mad.

97
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:50,360
Look what I brought you.

98
00:04:50,879 --> 00:04:52,240
Your favorite, Jianlibao.

99
00:04:52,959 --> 00:04:53,600
Thanks.

100
00:04:58,680 --> 00:04:59,279
Qianqian...

101
00:04:59,279 --> 00:05:00,279
I'm so sorry.

102
00:05:00,639 --> 00:05:01,959
I really didn't know that outfit was...

103
00:05:04,319 --> 00:05:05,240
It's all Ma Dawei's fault!

104
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:06,319
That deceitful jerk!

105
00:05:06,319 --> 00:05:07,319
He just had to say it out loud in public,

106
00:05:07,319 --> 00:05:08,399
leaving you totally humiliated.

107
00:05:08,879 --> 00:05:09,519
Nannan,

108
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:11,040
I don't blame you.

109
00:05:12,639 --> 00:05:15,800
I just feel so embarrassed.

110
00:05:16,040 --> 00:05:17,759
I saved up for so long

111
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:19,600
to buy a nice outfit

112
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:21,759
to wear to work,

113
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:22,879
so I'd look respectable

114
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:24,800
and no one would look down on me.

115
00:05:25,279 --> 00:05:26,199
Who knew

116
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:28,879
I still couldn't escape Ma Dawei's shadow?

117
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:34,240
Nannan,

118
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:37,240
what is going on with Ma Dawei?

119
00:05:37,839 --> 00:05:40,160
I thought he couldn't even find a job.

120
00:05:40,319 --> 00:05:42,399
How is he suddenly designing clothes?

121
00:05:43,279 --> 00:05:44,160
Him?

122
00:05:44,399 --> 00:05:46,199
Just blind luck!

123
00:05:46,439 --> 00:05:48,160
He drew a few trashy, revealing sketches,

124
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:48,759
and by sheer chance,

125
00:05:48,759 --> 00:05:50,519
they hit the latest fashion trend.

126
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:52,519
To be fair, though,

127
00:05:52,879 --> 00:05:54,879
our factory really did

128
00:05:54,879 --> 00:05:56,519
bounce back thanks to that batch.

129
00:05:58,199 --> 00:05:59,319
That's wonderful.

130
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:01,079
Uncle Dong can finally relax.

131
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:02,439
The factory is saved.

132
00:06:02,439 --> 00:06:03,600
Of course it is!

133
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:04,639
And what's more,

134
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:06,120
when I walked past the office today,

135
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:06,959
I even overheard

136
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:08,399
that Ma Dawei was on the phone with

137
00:06:08,399 --> 00:06:10,160
Yunding Department Store's leasing head!

138
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:12,079
If we land an exclusive counter,

139
00:06:12,079 --> 00:06:13,040
our Jinhua Garment Factory

140
00:06:13,199 --> 00:06:15,000
is really going to soar to the top!

141
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:18,199
Yunding Department Store...

142
00:06:18,800 --> 00:06:19,600
Ma Dawei,

143
00:06:19,959 --> 00:06:22,040
you want to turn your life around
through Jinhua Garment Factory?

144
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:23,639
Pipe dream!

145
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:25,720
I won't let you get what you want.

146
00:06:25,959 --> 00:06:26,720
Qianqian,

147
00:06:27,519 --> 00:06:28,920
about the outfit...

148
00:06:30,199 --> 00:06:30,879
It's fine.

149
00:06:31,079 --> 00:06:31,879
Really.

150
00:06:33,319 --> 00:06:33,800
Qianqian,

151
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:35,439
I knew you were the best!

152
00:06:37,519 --> 00:06:38,399
Let me open the Jianlibao for you.

153
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:40,399
Here.

154
00:06:40,759 --> 00:06:41,720
Thanks.

155
00:06:44,519 --> 00:06:45,279
You have some too.

156
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:50,639
That's the taste!

157
00:06:58,759 --> 00:06:59,519
Dawei.

158
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:01,160
Sister-in-law?

159
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:09,800
Why are you dressed up so late at night?

160
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:16,839
I...

161
00:07:23,959 --> 00:07:25,399
I've made up my mind.

162
00:07:26,879 --> 00:07:27,519
I...

163
00:07:31,920 --> 00:07:33,879
Today, wearing the outfit you designed,

164
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:34,680
I went back to visit my family.

165
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:36,040
You have no idea.

166
00:07:37,319 --> 00:07:38,959
Ever since your brother passed away,

167
00:07:40,360 --> 00:07:42,360
my own relatives

168
00:07:43,079 --> 00:07:44,319
avoided me like the plague,

169
00:07:44,759 --> 00:07:46,839
terrified I'd ask to borrow money.

170
00:07:47,279 --> 00:07:49,040
They wouldn't even look me in the eye.

171
00:07:51,079 --> 00:07:52,600
But the moment I walked in today,

172
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:54,519
they were completely stunned!

173
00:07:54,639 --> 00:07:56,759
My cousins were all swarming around me,

174
00:07:56,839 --> 00:07:58,279
asking about this outfit

175
00:07:58,759 --> 00:08:01,000
and which big city mall I bought it from.

176
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:02,240
They all praised how chic I looked!

177
00:08:03,720 --> 00:08:06,199
My parents walked down the street
with their heads held high!

178
00:08:12,279 --> 00:08:12,839
Dawei,

179
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:15,040
I don't know why,

180
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:16,959
but I felt such an immense sense of pride.

181
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:19,920
Today, I finally see it clearly.

182
00:08:20,279 --> 00:08:21,240
You're sharp,

183
00:08:21,639 --> 00:08:22,600
and you've got an incredible eye.

184
00:08:22,839 --> 00:08:23,360
You...

185
00:08:25,639 --> 00:08:27,040
You're far more capable than your brother.

186
00:08:29,839 --> 00:08:31,040
I don't want a salary.

187
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:33,240
I just want to work with you.

188
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:34,039
Will you let me?

189
00:08:35,159 --> 00:08:36,120
Boss Dawei?
